        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "ad8cb95f-cf59-33f4-baf4-71c384d607bf",
                "word": "напредки",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a203c6c-61a0-30c8-a8a0-513a96e44d68",
                        "entry_id": "ad8cb95f-cf59-33f4-baf4-71c384d607bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., разг., сниж. впредь, в будущем"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a023def5-070e-424c-bf06-f876d67479d8",
                                "sense_id": "8a203c6c-61a0-30c8-a8a0-513a96e44d68",
                                "text": "Он сказал: я-де это сказал с глупости, а напредки он тебя, государя, отцом называть не будет."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "670b357f-7759-4a03-aa08-95ffc273d3e3",
                                "sense_id": "8a203c6c-61a0-30c8-a8a0-513a96e44d68",
                                "text": "Что, как скажет зритель едкий, // Мненья общего орга́н: // «Нас поддели, но напре́дки // Не заманите в обман!»"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01ccb201-062d-404f-97da-178c8690989c",
                                "sense_id": "8a203c6c-61a0-30c8-a8a0-513a96e44d68",
                                "text": "А ежели глупостей своих напредки не оставишь, тогда уж не прогневайся: обязательно повесим, где бы ты ни был!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85dfbfdf-207d-4328-90f8-6be06c27f67a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ad8cb95f-cf59-33f4-baf4-71c384d607bf",
                        "source_sense_id": "8a203c6c-61a0-30c8-a8a0-513a96e44d68",
                        "target_lang_word": "henceforth",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "henceforth",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e3c2786-77b7-3d98-8632-d6201a0ca7f6",
                                        "entry_id": "cd435c67-fc19-380e-9437-ef9860d4124c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From now on; from this time on."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "temporal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d466c282-8947-4e33-a80f-68de012eb400",
                                                "sense_id": "6e3c2786-77b7-3d98-8632-d6201a0ca7f6",
                                                "text": "I will try to do a better job, henceforth, now that I know the proper technique!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "076230ea-4b0f-4ee9-898d-c02478ddaf5e",
                                                "sense_id": "6e3c2786-77b7-3d98-8632-d6201a0ca7f6",
                                                "text": "My thanes and kinsmen,/Henceforth be earls, the first that ever Scotland /In such an honour named"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d23453d5-b1af-484b-aaae-4183313a2f55",
                                                "sense_id": "6e3c2786-77b7-3d98-8632-d6201a0ca7f6",
                                                "text": "Henceforth, you shall be known as Darth...Vader."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51f6c79b-546f-397c-b74e-7835e836ffac",
                                        "entry_id": "cd435c67-fc19-380e-9437-ef9860d4124c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Further within this document."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f903c1a7-3a31-440c-bbca-6c8a546719ce",
                        "source_entry_id": "ad8cb95f-cf59-33f4-baf4-71c384d607bf",
                        "source_sense_id": "8a203c6c-61a0-30c8-a8a0-513a96e44d68",
                        "target_lang_word": "thenceforth",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thenceforth",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd04f639-068e-3681-95e4-254d3261a14d",
                                        "entry_id": "3f6eb00b-d319-3e5b-ae7d-0aeaa5331a17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From that time on."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b527a60-2cf6-4e82-b4d7-c110b182697b",
                                                "sense_id": "fd04f639-068e-3681-95e4-254d3261a14d",
                                                "text": "...to the end, that all such foes to the rights of British-America may be publicly known, and universally contemned as the enemies of American liberty; and thenceforth we respectively will break off all dealings with him or her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb0c1539-5a19-46b4-a4aa-a762c36e22b1",
                                                "sense_id": "fd04f639-068e-3681-95e4-254d3261a14d",
                                                "text": "Furthermore: you must know that when the second iron is thrown overboard, it thenceforth becomes a dangling, sharp-edged terror, skittishly curvetting about both boat and whale, entangling the lines, or cutting them, and making a prodigious sensation in all directions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "234a0367-cbbc-4869-a15b-ca71f6f95857",
                                                "sense_id": "fd04f639-068e-3681-95e4-254d3261a14d",
                                                "text": "The fear of losing Joe’s confidence, and of thenceforth sitting in the chimney corner at night staring drearily at my forever lost companion and friend, tied up my tongue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1c1d6e6-cc5c-47d9-8201-b93cd5bb31f1",
                                                "sense_id": "fd04f639-068e-3681-95e4-254d3261a14d",
                                                "text": "1927-1929 — Mahatma Gandhi, An Autobiography or The Story of my Experiments with Truth, \"Nirbal Ke Bala Rama\", translated 1940 by Mahadev Desai\nI decided to act thenceforth with great caution; not to leave the house, but somehow leave Portsmouth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c6f743e-267d-4620-9303-e3bd87628d33",
                                                "sense_id": "fd04f639-068e-3681-95e4-254d3261a14d",
                                                "text": "Here his hand trembled as he set his pen to the proclamation that declared slaves thenceforth and forever free."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6cdb3a12-6cbc-4b2e-869b-2e53fc4bb5f0",
